{
  "label": "mayafirsthall",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label mayafirsthall:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall1.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Maya. What are you up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What makes you think it’s okay to just approach me in the hallway?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...fact that I am also in the hallway? And that we know each other. And that it is customary to greet the people you know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you know Yumi as well?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall2.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Excellent. Go bother her instead, then. As you can see, I am in the middle of something very important.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you? Because it looks to me like you’re just trying to open the door.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not just trying to open the door. I’m attempting to escape from a man who would likely attempt to sodomize me if we were alone in the hallway right now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How come the two people who hate me the most had to choose today to hang out in the hall?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall1.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mondays, am I right?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Distaste for Mondays aside, what are you actually up to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall3.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why does it matter? It’s not like I’m planning on including you.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re kind of including me now by just responding to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall4.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I see.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Farewell.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maya, wait.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall5.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why? Am I seriously not even allowed to retreat into my own room without you attempting to get involved?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, I don’t plan on physically restraining you or anything. But would it kill you to converse with me for like, five minutes?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That depends entirely on what we’d talk about. I’m sure there are plenty of conversation topics that would put an end to both of us in a matter of seconds.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I highly doubt that’s-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not even supposed to be here. You know that, right? This is a dorm for girls.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How are we supposed to feel safe at night if you’re standing outside of our doors, pressing your face against them and listening in on our conversations?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just talk quieter if you’re worried about me listening in.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall6.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So it falls on us to traipse around your wrongdoings? Are you that opposed to even the faintest trace of dignity?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How about this? You hang out with me for the rest of the night and I promise to never press my face against your door without permission.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall7.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Counter-offer: How about you walk yourself off the nearest bridge and never set foot in this hallway again?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Only if you walk off with me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This...constant need to flirt with me will only make me hate you more, you know.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I actually figured you already hated me as much as possible. So it’s good knowing I’ve still got some time left to talk to you like this before we’re done for good.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway, do you come here often? I like your bell.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you have some time, would you maybe want to go out for dinner or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do not tempt me with free food. Not with that disgusting look on your face.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think this is just how I look.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It is. And it’s disgusting. Go away and never look at me again.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you at least ask Ami to come out if you’re going to take that much exception to my existence?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall8.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ami isn’t home at the moment. May I take a message?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. Tell her-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry. This person’s voice mailbox is currently full. Please hang up and try again.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall7.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am going back into my room now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do not attempt to follow me, and do not tell anyone that the two of us even spoke tonight.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Standing here and letting you hurl insults at me isn’t exactly speaking.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then you should have no problem doing exactly as I told you just now.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall2.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Goodbye.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mayahall0",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mayahall0.webp",
      "alt": "mayahall0"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You can’t say I didn’t try.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ maya_love += 1",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "$ mayafirsthall = True",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya’s affection has somehow increased to [maya_love]!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if day < 6:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump endofweekday",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
